  "description": "The Spearfish C DLX frameset is our endurance XC mountain bike frame designed for going the distance as efficiently as possible. Our new Deluxe carbon fiber construction shaves more than 250 grams off our standard carbon without a penalty in stiffness, durability, or ride quality. Spearfish’s stiffness is complemented by 120mm of Split Pivot rear suspension travel that’s optimized for both pedaling and braking performance.\n\nOn-bike cargo mounts make it easy to pack your ride essentials — including two bottles (up to three on MD–XL frames) and your repair kit; top tube mounts expand your capacity to our EXP-R Series Trillium Top Tube Bag or even a K-Edge computer mount.\n\nBuild your race-winning ride on this carbon endurance and XC mountain bike frame and see how far it can take you.",
